<div class="jtq-letter">

    {% set basic_salary = frappe.db.get_value("Employee Salary Component Detail", {
        "parent": doc.name,
        "parenttype": "Employee",
        "parentfield": "custom_employee_earnings",
        "salary_component": "Basic Salary"
    }, "amount") or 0 %}

    {% set medical_allowance = frappe.db.get_value("Employee Salary Component Detail", {
        "parent": doc.name,
        "parenttype": "Employee",
        "parentfield": "custom_employee_earnings",
        "salary_component": "Medical Allowance"
    }, "amount") or 0 %}

    {% set total_salary = basic_salary + medical_allowance %}

    <div class="jtq-title">آزمائشی تقرر نامہ برائے معلم / معلمہ</div>

    <table class="jtq-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">فائل نمبر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.name }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">کوڈ نمبر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.employee_number or doc.name }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">تاریخ</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(frappe.utils.today(), "dd/MM/yyyy") }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">محترم</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.employee_name or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">ولدیت</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.father_name or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">شناختی کارڈ نمبر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.cnic or doc.passport_number or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">موجودہ پتہ</td>
            <td colspan="3" class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.current_address or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">مستقل پتہ</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.permanent_address or doc.current_address or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">رابط ہ نمبر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.cell_number or doc.personal_phone or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">اکاؤنٹ نمبر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.bank_ac_no or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">بینک کا نام</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.bank_name or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">دینی تعلیم</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.custom_religious_education or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">عصری تعلیم</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.custom_education or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">شہادۃ العالمیہ</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.custom_shahadat_al_almiya or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">تاریخ تقرر</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.date_of_joining, "dd/MM/yyyy") if doc.date_of_joining else "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">مطابق</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ doc.custom_hijri_date or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">مقام تقرر</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.branch or doc.department or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">شاخ / حلقہ</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.branch or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">درجہ</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.designation or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">اوقات کار</td>
            <td class="jtq-urdu-line">{{ doc.custom_working_hours_text or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="jtq-label">ماہانہ مشاہرہ</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(basic_salary, currency="PKR") }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">میڈیکل الاؤنس</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(medical_allowance, currency="PKR") }}</td>
            <td class="jtq-label">کل رقم</td>
            <td class="jtq-line">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(total_salary, currency="PKR") }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="jtq-note">
        نوٹ: دیگر الاؤنس / مراعات آزمائشی تقرر مکمل ہونے اور مستقل تقرری پر لاگو ہونگے۔
    </div>

    <div class="jtq-sign">
        <div class="jtq-sign-line"></div>
        مینیجر ایچ آر
    </div>

    <div class="jtq-heading">ضروری ہدایات</div>

    <ul class="jtq-terms">
        <li>آپ کا تقرر آزمائشی ہے جس کی مدت چھ ماہ ہے۔ یہ مدت پوری ہونے پر ادارہ کی طرف سے کوئی شکایت نہ ہوئی تو یہ تقرر نامہ مستقل تصور ہو گا۔</li>
        <li>ادارے کے قواعد و ضوابط پر عمل نہ کرنے یا غیر اخلاقی حرکت کا مرتکب ہونے پر مطلوب کارروائی کی جائے گی جو سبکدوشی کا باعث بن سکتی ہے۔</li>
        <li>مستقل و آزمائشی تقرر کے دوران کسی بھی جگہ تعیناتی / تبادلہ کا مکمل اختیار ادارہ کا ہو گا اور مقرر اس کا پابند ہو گا۔</li>
        <li>مستقل تقرری پر اگر آپ ادارہ سے فارغ ہونا چاہیں تو کم از کم ایک ماہ کا نوٹس دیں گے، بصورت دیگر ایک ماہ مشاہرہ آپ کے ذمہ واجب الادا ہو گا۔</li>
        <li>اگر ادارہ آپ سے مزید خدمات نہیں لینا چاہتا تو آپ کو ایک ماہ کے نوٹس پر یا ایک ماہ کا مشاہرہ بطور نوٹس ادا کر کے فارغ کر سکتا ہے۔</li>
        <li>آزمائشی تقرر کے دوران رخصت خلاف ضابطہ ہے، البتہ کسی ایمرجنسی کی صورت اطلاع دے کر ایک یوم کی رخصت کی اجازت ہو گی۔</li>
        <li>اگر تقرر کے وقت بینک اکاؤنٹ تفصیل نہیں دی ہے تو ایک ہفتہ میں جمع کروانا ضروری ہے تاکہ مشاہرہ براہ راست اکاؤنٹ میں منتقل کیا جا سکے۔ بصورت دیگر مشاہرہ کی ادائیگی بذریعہ چیک کی جائے گی۔</li>
        <li>تمام الاؤنس / مراعات مستقل تقرری پر ہی لاگو ہوں گے۔</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="jtq-declaration">
        میں اقرار کرتا / کرتی ہوں کہ میں نے تمام ہدایات اور ذمہ داریوں کی تفصیل پڑھ اور سمجھ لی ہے۔
    </div>

    <div class="jtq-copy">
        کاپی برائے: دفتر نظامت * شعبہ حسابات * آفس فائل * متعلقہ
    </div>

    <div class="jtq-footer">
        مرکزی دفتر: اندرون عالمگیر مسجد، عالمگیر روڈ، بہادر آباد، کراچی۔ فون:
        <span class="ltr">021-34932283, 34935824</span>
        ای میل:
        <span class="ltr">info@jtq.edu.pk</span>
        <br>
        <span class="ltr">jtq.edu.pk | JTQTrustOfficial | jtqtrustofficial | 0333-4935824, 0334-4124333</span>
    </div>

</div>"}]

[{"fieldname": "print_heading_template", "fieldtype": "Custom HTML", "options": ""}, {"fieldtype": "Section Break", "label": ""}, {"fieldtype": "Column Break"}, {"fieldname": "_custom_html", "print_hide": 0, "label": "Custom HTML", "fieldtype": "HTML", "options": "{% set employee_id = doc.get("employee") or doc.get("employee_id") or doc.get("custom_employee") %}

{% if not employee_id and doc.get("job_applicant") %}
    {% set employee_id = frappe.db.get_value("Employee", {"job_applicant": doc.job_applicant}, "name") %}
{% endif %}

{% if not employee_id and doc.get("applicant_name") %}
    {% set employee_id = frappe.db.get_value("Employee", {"employee_name": doc.applicant_name}, "name") %}
{% endif %}

{% set employee = frappe.get_doc("Employee", employee_id) if employee_id else None %}

{% set employee_name = employee.employee_name if employee else (doc.get("applicant_name") or doc.name) %}
{% set employee_address = employee.current_address if employee else "" %}
{% set designation = employee.designation if employee else (doc.get("designation") or "Assistant Manager Administration") %}
{% set department = employee.department if employee else "Education Department" %}
{% set joining_date = employee.date_of_joining if employee else (doc.get("appointment_date") or doc.creation) %}
{% set appointment_date = doc.get("appointment_date") or joining_date %}

{% set salary = namespace(basic=0, medical=0) %}

{% if employee_id %}
    {% set earning_rows = frappe.get_all(
        "Employee Salary Component Detail",
        filters={
            "parent": employee_id,
            "parenttype": "Employee",
            "parentfield": "custom_employee_earnings"
        },
        fields=["salary_component", "amount"],
        limit_page_length=100
    ) %}

    {% for row in earning_rows %}
        {% set component = (row.salary_component or "")|lower|trim %}
        {% if component in ["basic", "basic salary"] or "basic" in component %}
            {% set salary.basic = row.amount or 0 %}
        {% elif component in ["medical allowance", "medical"] or "medical" in component %}
            {% set salary.medical = row.amount or 0 %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<style>
.print-heading,
.print-format h2,
.print-format > hr {
    display: none !important;
}

.print-format {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.22;
}

.appointment-letter {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 18mm 26mm 18mm 26mm;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

.date-line {
    text-align: right;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.address-block {
    white-space: pre-line;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.title {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.para {
    text-align: justify;
    margin-bottom: 11px;
}

.bold {
    font-weight: bold;
}

.section-title {
    margin-top: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 9px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.salary-table {
    margin-left: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}

.salary-table td {
    padding: 1px 10px 1px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
}

.terms {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 28px;
}

.terms li {
    margin-bottom: 13px;
    text-align: justify;
    padding-left: 4px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
}

.close-text {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: justify;
}

.signature-block {
    margin-top: 24px;
}

.manager {
    margin-top: 58px;
}

.acceptance {
    margin-top: 64px;
    font-style: italic;
}

.employee-sign {
    margin-top: 38px;
    line-height: 2.4;
}

@media print {
    @page {
        size: A4 portrait;
        margin: 14mm 22mm 14mm 22mm;
    }

    .appointment-letter {
        padding: 0 !important;
    }

    .terms li {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
}
</style>

<div class="appointment-letter">

    <div class="date-line">
        Date:
        <span class="bold">
            {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(appointment_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="address-block">
        <span class="bold">{{ employee_name }}</span>
        {% if employee_address %}
{{ employee_address }}
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="title">APPOINTMENT LETTER</div>

    <div class="para bold">
        Dear Mr. {{ employee_name }},
    </div>

    <div class="para">
        This is with reference to your employment application and your subsequent interviews with us.
        We are pleased to appoint you as
        <span class="bold">{{ designation }}</span>
        in
        <span class="bold">{{ department or "Education Department" }}</span>
        with effect from
        <span class="bold">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(joining_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}</span>.
    </div>

    <div class="para">
        A non-exhaustive list of the terms and conditions of your employment is provided as under:
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">
        A. &nbsp;&nbsp; REMUNERATION:
        <span style="font-weight: normal; margin-left: 22px;">
            (Your monthly gross salary break-up) :
        </span>
    </div>

    <table class="salary-table">
        <tr>
            <td>Basic Salary:</td>
            <td>Rs. {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(salary.basic or 0, currency=None) }} per Month</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Medical Allowance:</td>
            <td>
                Rs. {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(salary.medical or 0, currency=None) }} per Month
                {% if salary.medical %}
                    (After successful completion of probation period)
                {% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="para">
        In addition to the above, you shall be provided with other benefits proportionate to your grade
        as per organization policies.
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">
        B. &nbsp;&nbsp; TERMS AND CONDITIONS:
    </div>

    <ol class="terms">
        <li>
            The above break-up of Gross Salary may be modified according to organization’s policies
            however the gross salary as shown above will remain unchanged. Income tax and other
            applicable taxes will be borne by you as applicable.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will be on probation for a period of <span class="bold">Six (6) months</span> from the date
            of appointment, which may be extended at the sole discretion of the management. During
            the probationary period your services can be terminated without assigning any reason or notice thereof.
        </li>

        <li>
            After the successful completion of probationary period, either side may terminate the
            services after giving one calendar month notice in writing or one month gross salary in lieu thereof.
        </li>

        <li>
            The retirement age in our organization is set at sixty five (65) years. Such retirement age
            may be revised by the management, in their sole discretion, at any time.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will not disclose your salary and future compensations either directly or indirectly
            to any person within the organization.
        </li>

        <li>
            Your entitlement to avail leave will be in accordance with the organization policies,
            as framed and amended, from time to time.
        </li>

        <li>
            You may be transferred to any other department at the sole discretion of the management.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will be obligated to make good any loss or damage to the organization property caused
            by your negligence, inadvertence, fraud, carelessness or act or omission. Moreover, the
            termination of your service may not exonerate you from liability to make good this loss or damage.
        </li>

        <li>
            In case of breach of any of the terms of this appointment and any rules and regulations of
            service, or for any other misconduct, you will be subject to appropriate disciplinary action,
            as deemed fit by the management and which may lead to termination of your services.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will discharge all such duties, responsibilities and authorities as assigned to you,
            efficiently and diligently to the satisfaction of the management and you will not act in any
            manner contrary to the interest of the organization.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will promote the interest of the organization to the best of your abilities, skills and knowledge.
        </li>

        <li>
            During your employment or after its termination you will not disclose any information relating
            to the organization that you may obtain while you are in the service.
        </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="close-text">
        Kindly return the duplicate copy of this letter duly signed by you signifying your acceptance
        to the enclosed terms and conditions of this Appointment Letter.
    </div>

    <div class="signature-block">
        Yours Sincerely,<br>
        For <span class="bold">Trust Jamiat Talim-Ul-Quran</span>
    </div>

    <div class="manager">
        Manager HR
    </div>

    <div class="acceptance">
        I have read understood & hereby accept the above terms & conditions of appointment and
        agree to abide by the same.
    </div>

    <div class="employee-sign">
        <span class="bold">Signature:</span> _______________________________<br>
        <span class="bold">Name:</span> _______________________________<br>
        <span class="bold">Dated:</span> _______________________________
    </div>

</div>"}]
